omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I4sYH0u6PfwQ7kNvwH83kav&_nc_oc=Adpzr5IxTFEfp_RsbTmgAP9bEJcOe1AQoHrQuGtXO71aBRMK6LarP_kznW4o1wYwQTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8S4MHKkTuPztY1mgleBwiM4ublJRNNHTWsHVGGsWh8vA&oe=6A340D34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v1brd0JbJFkQ7kNvwGDbRm_&_nc_oc=Adpks5ct6PoP62oJbj4gdpfBcZF2FV_T9WQvSOAHZbgVLDlrjvYj6RhmGWGwvFXzZgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af83tI1XEHwj7CTNmaS6B8zmrtrYqn6ijWZ2XxlBqasNCw&oe=6A340E96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wX_G_Mg3fYsQ7kNvwGqavI5&_nc_oc=AdqSNakVC8olL8rdkAa8_dcLcp-osQJJAClXQoQz0kfWSkLVu0P4s5nNmRAjOIYD-MU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Bk_l1pY0saXe6QjLwYXT0SuGSAX9385G3RkUikY0r_Q&oe=6A33EB77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://